While walking through the forest, you trip and land on your face. As you
stand up, you look and see a hazy mist above your head. You begin to cough
spazmatically, and feel major pains in your chest. You suddenly become
freezing cold. You have caught some sort of disease. With your last ounces
of strength, you somehow manage to crawl back to town, thus infecting others
whom happen to be exposed to you...

Thou hast started a disease, and spread it through town... You may have
just made many enemies!
